From 19026c37ab46af4f5c9aae53005280101f0e5f96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aman <3285444+realav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 14:01:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: add new_tab_with_command keybind action
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Same idea as new_window_with_command, but opens a tab in the current
window — the common case for launching an agent alongside what you're
already doing.

The payload struct is now shared by both actions, so it's renamed from
NewWindowCommand to CommandOverride (ghostty_action_new_window_command_s
-> ghostty_action_command_override_s).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
